<title>DENMARK: Danish Hypotekbanken ups amount on 2002 4% bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Hypotekbanken ups amount on 2002 4% bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Hypotekbanken raised an existing four percent bond due 2005 by 100 million crowns to 400 million crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou and lead manager Jyske Bank said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Raaschou said the bonds were already sold. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969652</p>
